      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Who It's For\n\nTwilite is for people who need structure to stay alive as work gets more complex.\n\nStrong fits include:\n\n- software architecture\n- AI workspaces\n- research and investigation\n- product ecosystems\n- documentation systems\n- knowledge gardens\n- worldbuilding and design systems\n- planning graphs that need to stay navigable\n\nThe same runtime supports thinking, collaboration, publishing, execution, and navigation without switching mediums.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1778699635763,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
