      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# What Makes It Different\n\nTwilite overlaps with several categories without collapsing into any one of them.\n\nIt is not merely:\n\n- a whiteboard\n- a note app\n- a workflow graph\n- a documentation tool\n- a mind map\n- or a chat interface\n\nThe difference is that Twilite treats the graph itself as the durable semantic artifact: addressable, explorable, AI-readable, AI-editable, publishable, portable, and structurally meaningful.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
